<title>FRANCE: OECD - Key forecast by half year - Britain.</title>
<headline>OECD - Key forecast by half year - Britain.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are economic forecasts for Britain, made by the Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development and published on Thursday it is half-year economic report.</p>
<p>		    1996  1997  1998     1996	 1997	 1998</p>
<p>		    year  year  year    H1  H2     H1  H2     H1  H2</p>
<p> Real GDP	  2.1   3.0   2.7   2.1  2.5   3.2  3.1   2.6 2.4</p>
<p>(pct change annual rate)</p>
<p> Inflation pct   3.1   2.3   2.2   3.6  3.2   2.0  2.0   2.3 2.3</p>
<p>(GDP deflator)</p>
<p> Current account  0    0.2   0.2  -0.2  0.2    0   0.5  0.6 -0.2</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Unemployment    7.4   6.1   5.6   7.7  7.1   6.3  5.9   5.7 5.6</p>
<p>(pct of labour force)</p>
</text>
